#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:302
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_MakeThinkImJustKid"
msgid ""
"Fufufufufu.\p"
"I'm going to make everyone think\n"
"I'm just a kid and let them play down.\p"
"Then, I'll shock them and grab\n"
"the title!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:309
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_FallarborTentMyFavorite"
msgid ""
"You know how BATTLE TENTS offer\n"
"different events in different towns?\p"
"My favorite is definitely the BATTLE\n"
"TENT in FALLARBOR TOWN.\p"
"I think it's fantastic how TRAINERS\n"
"try to win with all their faith in\l"
"their POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_CameToCampOut"
msgid ""
"I heard something about some tent,\n"
"so I came to camp out.\p"
"I didn't know that tents these days\n"
"are so luxurious!\p"
"Since I'm here, I may as well try\n"
"my hand at battling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ScottLookingForSomeone"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"So you came out to this BATTLE TENT!\p"
"The people in these parts tend to be\n"
"easygoing and laid-back.\p"
"But, you see, what I'm looking for are\n"
"people with…\p"
"How should I say this?\p"
"Someone bursting with the desire\n"
"and the drive to win.\p"
"If there were a TRAINER like that,\n"
"I'd immediately…\p"
"Whoops! Never mind!\n"
"Keep working at it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ScottMakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Instead of wasting your\n"
"time with the likes of me, why not\l"
"make a challenge?$"
msgstr ""
